Voice-of-brand cleanup pass. Every user-visible em dash replaced (colon,
comma, sentence break, or parenthetical as appropriate). Every 'actually'
hedging tic dropped except in load-bearing copy where it does real work.

Also:
- Removes 'location: London / Lagos' from content/site.ts (dead field)
- Drops the Contact page 'Where we work' block that read from that field
- Updates areaServed JSON-LD to seven-entry list: UK, US, Nigeria, Ghana,
  Kenya, Uganda, Africa (per confirmed instructions)
- Terms of Service revisions:
  * §01 shortened to 'Breachrr Security operates under Breachrr Ltd.'
    (removes Companies House number and jurisdiction disclosure)
  * §03 generalised — payment terms deferred to each SOW
  * §08 generalised — governing law and jurisdiction deferred to each SOW
- Footer baseline: 'All rights reserved.' (drops 'Registered in England
  & Wales')

Bug fix caught during pass:
- Work page featured section header: 'What a program build-out looks
  like.' → 'What an assessment engagement looks like.' (Verixar was
  reclassified from Build to Assess in phase 5; header never updated)

Time-constraint drift caught and cleaned:
- '30-minute call', 'weekly progress reviews', 'twice a year',
  'three months' → sequence/regular language matching phase 5 rule
